R-E6 R-AP22 R-AP34 R-J7 R-EC20 R-YK2 R-TP8 (slice 249): a refused write is exit 20 (rejected): 403 forbidden (the claim of the job: run 1), 403 for the yank of the operator with --undo and --json (error.details has status and type), 404 for a release that is gone (run 3). One request each, no wait, no new token (only a 401 gets one). The text is the default of Registry.refuse for a write.
